	<h3>About the author</h3>
	<p><p><strong>Dennis Feller</strong> is a 63-year-old living on the outskirts of New York City. A lifetime Yankee fan despite having been born in Red Sox territory, Feller looks forward to retiring and getting back to, among other hobbies, table-top sports games such as BLM baseball and Paydirt football.</p>
